    <description><![CDATA[
# [Quokka.js](https://quokkajs.com) Visual Studio Code Extension

Quokka.js is a developer productivity tool for rapid JavaScript / TypeScript prototyping. Runtime values are updated and displayed in your IDE next to your code, as you type.

![Quokka.js in VS Code](https://quokkajs.com/assets/img/main-video.gif)

## Quick links

- [Docs](https://quokkajs.com/docs)
- [Issues/questions](https://github.com/wallabyjs/quokka)

]]></description>
    <summary>JavaScript and TypeScript playground in your editor.</summary>
    <releaseNotes>https://marketplace.visualstudio.com/items?itemName=wallabyjs.quokka-vscode#changelog</releaseNotes>
    <tags>vscode extension quokka-vscode</tags>
    <dependencies>
      <dependency id="chocolatey-vscode.extension" version="[1.1.0, 2.0.0)" />
    </dependencies>
  </metadata>
  <files>
    <file src="tools\**" target="tools" />
    <file src="legal\**" target="legal" />
  </files>
